    "observed_interaction": {
      "native_layout": "Home is the body heading; New Tab remains the selected shell tab and displayed address. The local clock, search field, separate Go, Ask AI and All apps controls, and native Apps, Library and Dashboard cards render at both viewport sizes.",
      "narrow_navigation": "A physical click on All apps opened the real catalogue in the same tab. Clicking the native New Tab rail button returned to the Home body. The private X11 clipboard copied exactly overnight-unsent-query from the retained input.",
